  "description": "iQIYI brings you a premium library of Chinese dramas, Korean dramas, Thai dramas, anime, variety shows and movies that goes beyond the basics. Download iQIYI now and immerse yourself in a world of endless entertainment, including our exclusive iQIYI Originals you won't find anywhere else.\n\n[Features Built for You]\n- Watch for Free: Access a massive selection of high-quality shows at no cost.\n- Multi-Language Experience: Don’t let a language barrier stop you. We provide professional subtitles and a fully localized UI in English, Spanish, Thai, Malay, and more.\n- Cinematic Experience: Immerse yourself in 4K Ultra HD and Dolby Audio for a true theater-like experience right on your phone or tablet.\n- VIP Perks: Skip the ads, unlock \"Early Access\" to new episodes, and enjoy exclusive member-only content.\n- Multi-Device Sync: Start watching on your phone, tablet, or TV, and pick up exactly where you left off, anytime, anywhere.\n- Seamless User Experience: Navigate effortlessly with our clean...",
  "release_notes": "This release is full of bug fixes, performance updates, and improved stability to provide you a better iQIYI experience. Keep it updated so you've always got the latest and greatest.",
